MOVE PILL to XY
	Check XY
		NOGO :
			Get TASK for PILL.COLOR
			MOVE PILL.XY to TASK.UV
			break
		SOMTHING :
			Get PILLS at UV
			LOOP PILLS:PILL
				Get TASK for PILL.COLOR
				MOVE PILL.XY to TASK.UV
		DEFAULT :
			GO PILL.XY
			GRAB
			GO XY
			DROP

SET Color at XY
	Get PILL for Color
	CHECK PILL.XY
		NOGO :
			return SET Color at XY
		NOTHING : 
			return SET Color at XY
		PILL.COLOR != Color :
			return SET Color at XY
	MOVE PILL to XY